# Post-change gate (mandatory)

When this turn created or edited code under `fe/` or `be/` (or shared contracts), **before** the final user reply:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/post-change-gate/SKILL.md`
2. Complete review → FE↔BE sync → tests → commit + push (unless user forbade push)
3. End with the short gate report from that skill

Do not skip because the change “looks small.” Skip push only if the skill’s “When NOT to push” applies.
